---
// Work in Progress Page
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>JBS - Coming Soon</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0088CC 0%, #005A8C 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .logo {
            width: 400px;
            max-width: 90%;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            animation: logoFadeIn 1.2s ease-in;
        }

        @keyframes logoFadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: scale(0.9);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .spinner {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            border: 5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-top-color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        .contact-info {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .contact-info a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .contact-info a:hover {
            border-bottom-color: white;
        }

        .background-shapes {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: -1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .shape {
            position: absolute;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .shape1 {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            top: -150px;
            right: -150px;
            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .shape2 {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            bottom: -100px;
            left: -100px;
            animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite reverse;
        }

        .shape3 {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            top: 50%;
            left: 10%;
            animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0px);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-20px);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .logo {
                width: 300px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="background-shapes">
        <div class="shape shape1"></div>
        <div class="shape shape2"></div>
        <div class="shape shape3"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <img src="/jbs-logo.png" alt="JBS Construction - Built Different" class="logo" />
        <h1>We're Building... Something Different</h1>
        <p>Our website is currently under construction (ironically, we know). We promise we're better at building actual buildings than we are at finishing websites on time. 🏗️</p>
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; opacity: 0.85;">Check back soon for something worth the wait!</p>
        
        <div class="spinner"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
